{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测WindowsPowerShell脚本中编码可执行文件。对应需求：执行。官方：Suspicious Portable Executable Encoded in Powershell Script。","from":"now-9m","index":["winlogbeat-*","logs-windows.powershell*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】WindowsPowerShell脚本中编码可执行文件","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindowsPowerShell脚本中编码可执行文件\n\n### 为何重要\n在主机上执行命令或脚本\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程、用户与事件ID。\n2. 核对路径、注册表、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与凭据操作。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件与账号。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","references":["https://github.com/atc-project/atc-data/blob/master/docs/Logging_Policies/LP_0109_windows_powershell_script_block_log.md"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"ad84d445-b1ce-4377-82d9-7c633f28bf9a","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 执行","来源: 默认","对应需求: 执行"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"query","query":"event.category:process and host.os.type:windows and\n  powershell.file.script_block_text : (\n    TVqQAAMAAAAEAAAA\n  ) and not user.id : \"S-1-5-18\"\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","winlog.event_data.TargetUserName","message"]},"threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1059","name":"Command and Scripting Interpreter","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1059.001","name":"PowerShell","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1027","name":"Obfuscated 